Description: Functions for fitting adaptive deep tensor networks for nonlinear
    function-on-function regression with multiple functional and scalar
    predictors. The package learns predictor-specific functional bases
    end-to-end through differentiable quadrature and constructs interpretable
    coefficient surfaces on the response grid. It includes tools for model
    fitting, cross-validation, hyperparameter tuning, prediction, split
    conformal prediction bands, extraction and visualization of learned model
    components, training summaries, and simulation-based data generation.
